---
import Layout from '@layouts/Page.astro';
import LinkList from '@components/LinkList.astro';
import YouTube from '@components/YouTube.astro';
import { musicConcerts } from '@links/registry';
---

<Layout title="Molly Tuttle">
  <LinkList slot="sidebar" items={musicConcerts} orientation="vertical" />

  <p>
    This was my second time seeing Molly Tuttle. It was my first time at the historic Fillmore Theater. I
    loved the venue and seeing all the photos of prior concerts. It was also my first time being in general
    admission, meaning I had to battle the crowds. Thankfully they were really nice and I got a place just
    behind the stage and had a great view.
    </p>
 
  <p> This was in support of her So Long Little Miss Sunshine album which I really loved. </p>


</Layout>

